  </Markdown>
  <WordUsage id="demo_trans" target="demo_text" mode="transition_words">however, therefore, furthermore, moreover, nevertheless, consequently, meanwhile, additionally, similarly, in contrast, on the other hand, for example, in conclusion</WordUsage>

